{"nodes": [{"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_positioning_icp_and_gtm_positioning__icp___go_to_market", "label": "Positioning, ICP & Go-to-Market", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/positioning-icp-and-gtm.md", "source_location": "document", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_positioning_icp_and_gtm_size_the_market_with_tam___sam___som__and_know_which_one_matters_", "label": "Size the market with TAM \u2192 SAM \u2192 SOM (and know which one matters)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/positioning-icp-and-gtm.md", "source_location": "section: Size the market with TAM \u2192 SAM \u2192 SOM (and know which one matters)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Your real market is far smaller than the population \u2014 TAM is a theoretical ceiling (Brazil's 213M becomes ~101M credit-card holders for a paid app). Investors often ignore a TAM under ~R$1B, but the number that matters is the **SOM** \u2014 what you can actually capture."}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_positioning_icp_and_gtm_frame_the_referral_prize_as_a_gift_to_the_friend__not_a_commission_to_the_referrer", "label": "Frame the referral prize as a gift to the friend, not a commission to the referrer", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/positioning-icp-and-gtm.md", "source_location": "section: Frame the referral prize as a gift to the friend, not a commission to the referrer", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Member-get-member (MGM) referral programs win on framing and timing, not just on a two-sided reward. Money makes the exchange feel transactional; an in-product benefit feels like a genuine gift."}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_positioning_icp_and_gtm_pick_a_deliberately_under_served_niche_as_your_icp", "label": "Pick a deliberately under-served niche as your ICP", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/positioning-icp-and-gtm.md", "source_location": "section: Pick a deliberately under-served niche as your ICP", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A clear ICP (ideal customer profile) is not \"everyone who could use my product.\" It's a deliberately chosen, under-served niche \u2014 and a sharp niche beats no niche, because you can't out-fight the entrenched generalist giant."}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_positioning_icp_and_gtm_don_t_claim_plg_without_the_four_structural_conditions", "label": "Don't claim PLG without the four structural conditions", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/positioning-icp-and-gtm.md", "source_location": "section: Don't claim PLG without the four structural conditions", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Product-led growth (PLG) is a consequence of structural conditions, not a product decision you declare. Most B2B SaaS that pitches PLG is really sales-led wearing a PLG label."}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_positioning_icp_and_gtm_charge_your_first_ten_users_from_day_one", "label": "Charge your first ten users from day one", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/positioning-icp-and-gtm.md", "source_location": "section: Charge your first ten users from day one", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The first ten users define the product's entire curve, and payment is the cheapest test of real pain \u2014 curiosity is free, an open wallet demands a concrete problem."}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_positioning_icp_and_gtm_reverse_engineer_the_funnel_math_before_celebrating_an_mrr_target", "label": "Reverse-engineer the funnel math before celebrating an MRR target", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/positioning-icp-and-gtm.md", "source_location": "section: Reverse-engineer the funnel math before celebrating an MRR target", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Building the product is the easy part; distribution is the game. A revenue target is really a traffic-and-retention problem, and churn quietly resets the whole funnel every month."}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_positioning_icp_and_gtm_concentrate_channels_with_the_bullseye_framework__not_scattershot_testing", "label": "Concentrate channels with the Bullseye framework, not scattershot testing", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/positioning-icp-and-gtm.md", "source_location": "section: Concentrate channels with the Bullseye framework, not scattershot testing", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Testing ten channels at once means you never know what drove results and you blame the channel when the business stalls. Distribution needs prioritized focus \u2014 and a perfect channel still fails if the receiving structure leaks."}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_positioning_icp_and_gtm_diagnose_the_bottleneck__no_entries_is_distribution__leaving_without_paying_is_design", "label": "Diagnose the bottleneck: no entries is distribution, leaving without paying is design", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/positioning-icp-and-gtm.md", "source_location": "section: Diagnose the bottleneck: no entries is distribution, leaving without paying is design", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Design can't save a \"ghost product.\" Design optimizes and raises the LTV of something that already has traffic; it can't manufacture demand."}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_positioning_icp_and_gtm__richardrx___2026_06_25", "label": "@richardrx \u00b7 2026-06-25", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/positioning-icp-and-gtm.md", "source_location": "link: @richardrx \u00b7 2026-06-25", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "reference_url": "https://x.com/richardrx/status/2070140923380420796"}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_positioning_icp_and_gtm__richardrx___2026_06_02", "label": "@richardrx \u00b7 2026-06-02", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/positioning-icp-and-gtm.md", "source_location": "link: @richardrx \u00b7 2026-06-02", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "reference_url": "https://x.com/richardrx/status/2061766945582559509"}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_positioning_icp_and_gtm__richardrx___2026_05_19", "label": "@richardrx \u00b7 2026-05-19", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/positioning-icp-and-gtm.md", "source_location": "link: @richardrx \u00b7 2026-05-19", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "reference_url": "https://x.com/richardrx/status/2056789797646029232"}, {"id": "_agents_skills_revenue_centric_design_references_positioning_icp_and_gtm__richardrx___2026_05_04", "label": "@richardrx \u00b7 2026-05-04", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".agents/skills/revenue-centric-design/references/positioning-icp-and-gtm.m